\begin_inset Formula $i$
\end_inset

th specie and 
\begin_inset Formula $S_{\mathrm{cg},i}$
\end_inset

 denotes the corresponding ChemGen-predicted source term.
 If the magnitude of the Cantera source term is less than 
\begin_inset Formula $10^{-10}$
\end_inset

