caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 show the distribution of temperature and hydroxyl radical mass fraction,
 
\begin_inset Formula $Y_{OH}$
\end_inset

,
 at 
\begin_inset Formula $t=200\text{ }\mu$
\end_inset

s.
 These results are consistent with those produced using the existing seulex ODE integrator,
 which are not reported here for brevity.
 Figures
\begin_inset space ~
\end_inset


\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "fig:RRCGO"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 and
\begin_inset space ~
\end_inset


\begin_inset CommandInset ref
